Description
  A bash script for Ubuntu designed to seamlessly integrate the advantages of NaiveProxy, sing-box, and SOCKS5, so you can tunnel all you desire, mainly by providing user custom configuration templates for sing-box (Version: v1.15.0-alpha.9).

Features
  - Only support "sing-box-1.15.0-alpha.9-linux"

  + Combine the advantages of NaiveProxy(Chromium-like) protocol, sing-box naked core and SOCKS5 protocol
      - NaiveProxy mimics real Chromium TLS and HTTP/2, so it reads as an ordinary browser tab

  + Install sing-box on Ubuntu Linux via dpkg
      - Command: curl -fsSL https://sing-box.app/install.sh | sh -s -- --version 1.15.0-alpha.9

  + Provide a JSON Schema Draft 2020-12 for configuration files, compatible editors can use it for completion and validation
      - JSON Schema URL: https://sing-box.sagernet.org/schema.json

  - Support the sing-box dashboard using the sing-box API service, which provides a gRPC server for the sing-box server

  + NIC forwarding
      + Physical NIC(Proxy: naive) -4-> Virtual NIC: sing-tun0 -2-> Proxy: socks5 -2-> Physical NIC
          + chromium-like4tun
              - naive4sing-tun
          + tun2socks
              - sing-tun2socks5

  + Install Golang and the Caddy binary with "klzgrad/forwardproxy@naive" padding layer, combining both in one
      - Command: go install github.com/caddyserver/xcaddy/cmd/xcaddy@latest
      - Command: ~/go/bin/xcaddy build --with github.com/caddyserver/forwardproxy=github.com/klzgrad/forwardproxy@naive
      - The Caddy binary is "/usr/bin/caddy"

  + The Caddy configuration files directory is "/etc/caddy"
      + Provide a Caddy configuration file template
          - /etc/caddy/Caddyfile

  + Provide a fake "Download Chromium" website and its assets to resist active probing by the GFW
      - /var/www/html

  + Provide two sing-box user custom configuration templates on Ubuntu Linux Server platform
      + sing-box configuration files directory is "/etc/sing-box"
          - config.ipv4.obfs.chromium-like.json5
          - config.obfs.chromium-like.json5
      - sing-box run -c /etc/sing-box/config[.ipv4].obfs.chromium-like.json5

  - Provide some sing-box user custom configuration templates on Ubuntu Linux Desktop, macOS and Windows platforms

  + Support two cron schedules
      - /usr/local/bin/caddy-run-cron.sh
      - /usr/local/bin/sing-box-run-cron.sh

  - Support both IPv4-only and dual-stack

  + Support sing-box naked core and all official GUI clients
      - sing-box naked core
      - sing-box API
      - sing-box dashboard
      - SFL
      - SFA
      - SFM
      - SFI
      - SFT
      - SFW

